<div class="@Css" @ondragenter="() => SetDepth(_depth + 1)" @ondragleave="() => SetDepth(_depth - 1)" @ondrop="() => SetDepth(0)"
     @ondragover:preventDefault="true" @ondragenter:preventDefault="true">
    @ChildContent
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public string? Class { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string ActiveClass { get; set; } = "drop-zone-active";
    [Parameter] public bool Active { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<bool> ActiveChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }

    int _depth;

    string Css => Active ? $"drop-zone {Class} {ActiveClass}".Trim() : $"drop-zone {Class}".Trim();

    async Task SetDepth(int depth) {
        _depth = Math.Max(0, depth);
        var active = _depth > 0;
        if (active == Active) return;
        Active = active;
        await ActiveChanged.InvokeAsync(active);
    }
}
